{"id": "tea:paingala-upanisad:1", "source": "src:paingala-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "1"}, "paraphrase": "Paiṅgala, after twelve years' service, asks Yājñavalkya; from the witness with māyā arise the avyakta (Īśvara), mahat (Hiraṇyagarbha) and ahaṃkāra (Virāṭ); by quintuplication the gross elements and the world.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "cosmic", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["world-fate"], "teachers": ["tch:paingala", "tch:yajnavalkya"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:paingala-upanisad:2", "source": "src:paingala-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "2"}, "paraphrase": "The three bodies and the jīva's waking, dream and deep sleep; the jīva wanders like a caterpillar.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "analytic", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["consciousness-mind", "body-layers"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:paingala-upanisad:3", "source": "src:paingala-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "3"}, "paraphrase": "By hearing, reflecting on and contemplating the great sayings one realizes identity; the knower is liberated while living; at the body's fall, like ghee poured into ghee, he merges.", "tags": {"level": "bridging", "standpoint": "seeker", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "intermediate"}, "types": ["karma-liberation"], "concepts": ["cpt:mahavakyas", "cpt:jivanmukti"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
